{
 "id": "0084-mensural-idem-look",
 "about": "The mensural reader used to an Alamire hand's look: the Occo Codex's pages (IDEM; saved on this computer) measured (parchment, ink, lines, staff size; idemstyle.py measure: only bare parchment and a few numbers kept) and 20,000 staves of music (mensjrp, mens5) drawn in that look; from 0082 (the app's), with the synthetic staves, Capitan and seils2. Tested against 0082 on Capitan, seils2 and, as a test only (CMME's labels, private), Occo's held-out staves. Exported if better and nothing worse (nothing of CMME's in it). (0083 again: refused by a worker started before its update; the words now in a gothic hand.)",
